hcal T,\\vec E,\\theta)\\)</span> abbreviates increasing extender lengths together with the standard least-predecessor condition</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}normal\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash \\mathrm{NormalIterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec E,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\\;(\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\alpha)\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\beta))\\land\\forall\\alpha+1&lt;\\theta\\;\\left(\\operatorname{pred}_{\\mathcal T}(\\alpha+1)=\\min_{&lt;_{\\mathcal T}}\\{\\beta\\leq\\alpha:\\operatorname{crit}(E_\\alpha)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\beta)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}normal\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash \\mathrm{NormalIterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec E,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\theta\\;(\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\alpha)\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\beta))\\land\\forall\\alpha+1&lt;\\theta\\;\\left(\\operatorname{pred}_{\\mathcal T}(\\alpha+1)=\\min_{&lt;_{\\mathcal T}}\\{\\beta\\leq\\alpha:\\operatorname{crit}(E_\\alpha)&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(E_\\beta)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}iterable\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\land\\forall\\mathcal T,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec{\\mathcal M},\\vec E,\\vec i,\\mathcal M,\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{NormalIterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\vec E,\\theta)\\to\\exists b\\subseteq\\theta\\;(\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,\\theta,&lt;_{\\mathcal T})\\land\\sup b=\\theta\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7WellFoundedIteration}_S(\\mathcal T\